<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>My journal</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { background: #e9e3d6; color: #342a22; }
    body { margin: 0; font: 1.125rem/1.62 "Crimson Text", Georgia, serif; }
    main { max-width: 47rem; min-height: 100vh; margin: auto; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 4.75rem);
           background: #fffcf4; border-inline: 1px solid #d5c9b6; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 5rem); font-style: italic; font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.1;
         letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: 0 0 2rem; padding-bottom: .35em; border-bottom: 3px double #a38c6c; }
    section + section { border-top: 1px solid #d5c9b6; margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 2rem; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.22; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    h2 small { display: block; margin-bottom: .6rem; color: #745435; font: 600 .78rem/1.2 "Work Sans", sans-serif;
               text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .13em; }
    p { margin: .65rem 0; }
    figure { margin: .5rem 0 1.5rem; }
    pre { width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; padding: .75rem 1rem; margin: 0;
          border: 1px solid #d5c9b6; font: 1rem/1.5 "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; }
    figcaption { margin-top: .25rem; font-size: .875rem; color: #675545; }
    @media print {
      html, main { background: white; }
      main { padding: 0; border: 0; max-width: none; min-height: 0; }
      h1, h2 { break-after: avoid; }
      .passage { break-inside: avoid; }
      p { orphans: 2; widows: 2; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>My journal</h1>
  {{if .HasMaps}}<details><summary>Map key</summary>
    <p>@ is me, a is another person, . is open ground, # is a wall and ? is out of sight.
       A door is + when closed and / when open. A container is C when closed and c when open.
       Each * is a visible item, T marks a telephone, and y or Y marks a plant.
       Symbols grouped together share a square.</p>
  </details>{{end}}
  {{range .Chapters}}<section>
    <h2><small>Chapter {{.Number}}</small> {{.Title}}</h2>
    {{range .Passages}}<div class="passage"><p>{{.Text}}</p>
      {{with .Grid}}<figure><pre>{{.}}</pre><figcaption>My view at the time</figcaption></figure>{{end}}
    </div>{{end}}
  </section>
  {{else}}<p>{{.Empty}}</p>{{end}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
